## 🛠️ Setup

### Prerequisites

- Python 3.9+
- pip

### Installation

```bash
# Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv

# Activate virtual environment
# Windows:
venv\Scripts\activate
# Linux/Mac:
source venv/bin/activate

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Configuration

Create a `.env` file in the project root:

```env
# Database
{% if project.database_config %}
DATABASE_URL={{ project.database_config.type }}://user:password@{{ project.database_config.host or 'localhost' }}{% if project.database_config.port %}:{{ project.database_config.port }}{% endif %}/{{ project.database_config.database_name }}
{% else %}
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./app.db
{% endif %}

{% if project.security_config and project.security_config.auth_strategy == 'jwt' %}
# Security
{{ project.security_config.jwt_secret_env_var }}=your-secret-key-here-change-in-production
{% endif %}

# Application
DEBUG=True
```

## 🚀 Running

```bash
# Development mode (with auto-reload)
uvicorn server:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000

# Production mode
uvicorn server:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --workers 4
```

The API will be available at: `http://localhost:8000`

